       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjustments to D-pad input",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Centaurs and Chirons will no longer have their movement reduced on forested terrain",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・If the CPU attacks a player base during the Invasion Phase, it will not attack that same base the following season",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Various fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your continued support. We look forward to bringing you more updates in the future.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
